OL,3,ATwelve arrested in connection with
OL,4,AMiddlesbrough crash that killed two
OL,5,Apolice officers
OL,6,
OL,7,FBBC Verify has been looking through
OL,8,Fsocial media accounts - one video,
OL,9,Fpublished on TikTok last year,
OL,10,Fseemingly shows Saddington involved in
OL,11,Fwhat appears to be a police car chase
OL,13,FDefence minister Luke Pollard says he
OL,14,Fwants social media sites to remove
OL,15,Fposts celebrating dangerous driving
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
