OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AIran faces 'greatest financial
OL,4,Aoffensive ever', says US treasury
OL,5,Asecretary
OL,6,
OL,7,FBessent's threat to the Iranian regime
OL,8,Ffollows several U-turns and extended
OL,9,Fdeadlines from US President Donald
OL,10,FTrump's administration on previous
OL,11,Fthreats.
OL,13,FIran dismissed Bessent's comments and
OL,14,Fsaid it would shut down all oil exports
OL,15,Ffrom the region "if the war continues",
OL,16,Faccording to news agency Reuters.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
